.\",\"x\":0.39547614120617003,\"y\":0.6717059114310917},{\"width\":0.4970178723122772,\"height\":0.0145349477712029,\"text\":\"Then Mr. Lee, who had studied and also taught in Wah\",\"x\":0.2664016055933642,\"y\":0.6889534560363135},{\"width\":0.2783300226384944,\"height\":0.01453491857075151,\"text\":\"Yan, delivered to us his address.\",\"x\":0.5208747454733308,\"y\":0.7049418430402057},{\"width\":0.2365805070030499,\"height\":0.015988401481305314,\"text\":\"His subject was social work.\",\"x\":0.268389668599204,\"y\":0.7049418460374481},{\"width\":0.5330575001218527,\"height\":0.01899694138318786,\"text\":\"He said that social work, as a career, was comparatively new\",\"x\":0.2662662159162845,\"y\":0.7188313997435467},{\"width\":0.027833003623812802,\"height\":0.013081398383025689,\"text\":\"in\",\"x\":0.7733598405340181,\"y\":0.7369186029160453},{\"width\":0.5069582254066398,\"height\":0.014534948392489033,\"text\":\"Hong Kong. Due to rapid economic growth, many social\",\"x\":0.26640160933942353,\"y\":0.7383720607238136},{\"width\":0.532803186970811,\"height\":0.014534950877633901,\"text\":\"problems such as the generation gap, unemployment and vice\",\"x\":0.26640158210107573,\"y\":0.7543604314797877},{\"width\":0.5349604696725991,\"height\":0.01758119042610895,\"text\":\"appeared. They were waiting to be solved by social workers.\",\"x\":0.2663142269855994,\"y\":0.7699219703429134},{\"width\":0.5328031869708111,\"height\":0.01453495087763379,\"text\":\"To be a social worker, one should equip oneself with adequate\",\"x\":0.266401594089147,\"y\":0.7877906640597296},{\"width\":0.39960239022810834,\"height\":0.014534935345478894,\"text\":\"knowledge, and should have love for others.\",\"x\":0.3996023864714329,\"y\":0.8037790438262105},{\"width\":0.11928429153088793,\"height\":0.011627921685333775,\"text\":\"Mr. Lee also\",\"x\":0.2664015937971802,\"y\":0.8052325508336897},{\"width\":0.5347912358302696,\"height\":0.011627975115946931,\"text\":\"added that a social worker should work from interest but not\",\"x\":0.26441352186617745,\"y\":0.819767407761794},{\"width\":0.08548708013034756,\"height\":0.011627917336330396,\"text\":\"for riches.\",\"x\":0.715705763041188,\"y\":0.8357558084630522},{\"width\":0.4970178723122771,\"height\":0.013081459269073226,\"text\":\"The ceremony ended with a vote of thanks given by the\",\"x\":0.26640160683590897,\"y\":0.853197642440318},{\"width\":0.11133200769543439,\"height\":0.011627921685333775,\"text\":\"Head Prefect.\",\"x\":0.6858846908640124,\"y\":0.8691860391282633},{\"width\":0.41550694429938173,\"height\":0.014534935966765028,\"text\":\"And we had a performance given by our school\",\"x\":0.2664016043579299,\"y\":0.8691860204371601},{\"width\":0.17296222271978756,\"height\":0.013081417021611697,\"text\":\"orchestra and choir.\",\"x\":0.6262425459959711,\"y\":0.8851744075502407}]",
